# Capacity-test artifacts.
# Summary + meta are small and committed as evidence. Raw k6 sample dumps at
# high request rates reach tens of MB, so they stay local or ship as a release
# attachment instead of bloating the repository.
load-tests/results/_warmup.json
load-tests/results/capacity-*.json
load-tests/results/capacity-*.prometheus.txt
load-tests/results/capacity-*.container-stats.txt
!load-tests/results/capacity-*.summary.json
!load-tests/results/capacity-*.meta.json
